{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-cost-metering-chargeback","title":"GPU 成本计量、装箱与配额核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/operations-observability-cost/gpu-cost-metering-chargeback","wordCount":2360,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"gpu-成本计量-装箱与配额核算\">GPU 成本计量、装箱与配额核算</h1><p>财务把一张月账单拍在 SRE 桌上：这个月 A100 集群花了 18 万美元，请按团队出分摊表。集群承载 40 个命名空间、600 个 Pod、每天 3 万个训练与推理作业，而云账单只有一条——<code>p4d.24xlarge × 每小时 32.77 美元</code>。这中间隔着一整套&quot;计量&quot;工程：Kubernetes 只知道谁<strong>申请</strong>了几张卡，DCGM 只知道每张卡<strong>用</strong>了多少 SM，云账单只知道节点<strong>开着</strong>多少小时。三者互不相等，chargeback 的全部难点就是把它们对齐。本文承接 <a href=\"../gpu-device-model-k8s/gpu-hardware-cuda-abstract\">GPU 硬件架构与 CUDA 执行模型</a> 的物理计量单位、<a href=\"../gpu-scheduling-topology/extended-resource-scheduling\">扩展资源调度</a> 的整数资源约束，把&quot;一张卡的费用&quot;变成&quot;一个 Pod 的账单&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三份互相矛盾-缺一不可的数据源\">核心概念：三份互相矛盾、缺一不可的数据源</h2><p>GPU 成本分摊之所以比 CPU 难，是因为三份数据由三个互不通气的系统产生，口径彼此矛盾。</p>\n<p>第一份是 <strong>Kubernetes 的 request</strong>。<code>nvidia.com/gpu</code> 是扩展资源，Kubernetes 明确规定<strong>扩展资源不可超卖</strong>：<code>requests</code> 被复制为 <code>limits</code>，调度器只比对&quot;节点 <code>allocatable</code> 减去所有 Pod 的 request 之和&quot;，<strong>完全不看运行时利用率</strong>〔<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/configuration/manage-resources-containers/\">K8s: Manage Resources for Containers</a>〕。一张空闲的 H100 只要被 Pod 申请，调度器就当它 100% 占用——request 口径给出的是<strong>预留成本</strong>，不是<strong>使用成本</strong>。</p>\n<p>第二份是 <strong>DCGM 的 utilization</strong>。GPU Operator 部署的 dcgm-exporter 以 Prometheus 端点暴露每张卡的状态，与成本直接相关的默认指标包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>分摊用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL</code></td>\n<td>SM 占用比率</td>\n<td>判断卡是否闲置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_USED</code> / <code>DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_FREE</code></td>\n<td>帧缓冲已用/可用</td>\n<td>显存配额与超卖检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DCGM_FI_DEV_POWER_USAGE</code></td>\n<td>板卡功耗（瓦）</td>\n<td>能耗成本、PUE 分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DCGM_FI_DEV_TOTAL_ENERGY_CONSUMPTION</code></td>\n<td>累计能耗（counter）</td>\n<td>按周期积分出千瓦时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DCGM_FI_PROF_PIPE_TENSOR_ACTIVE</code></td>\n<td>Tensor Core 活跃比率</td>\n<td>训练作业真实算力占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DCGM_FI_PROF_SM_ACTIVE</code> / <code>DCGM_FI_PROF_SM_OCCUPANCY</code></td>\n<td>SM 活跃/占用率（可选）</td>\n<td>区分&quot;占着不用&quot;与&quot;跑满&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些指标带 <code>gpu</code>、<code>UUID</code>、<code>pci_bus_id</code>、<code>device</code>、<code>modelName</code> 标签，Kubernetes 映射还能补上 <code>pod</code>、<code>namespace</code>、<code>container</code>；MIG 模式下额外带 <code>GPU_I_PROFILE</code> 与 <code>GPU_I_ID</code>〔<a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/dcgm/latest/reference/dcgm-exporter-metrics.html\">DCGM Exporter Metrics</a>〕。utilization 给出的是<strong>实际消耗</strong>（usage），但只覆盖计算时段，且采样间隔内的高频抖动会被平滑掉。</p>\n<p>第三份是<strong>云账单或资产折旧</strong>。它按小时计费，无论 Pod 是否在跑——这是<strong>资产成本</strong>（asset cost）。</p>\n<p>OpenCost 规范对这三者的调和方式是统一的：对&quot;按分配计费&quot;的资源，工作负载成本取 <strong><code>max(request, usage)</code></strong>〔<a href=\"https://opencost.io/docs/specification/\">OpenCost Specification</a>〕。单个 Pod 在时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 小时内的 GPU 成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cost</mtext><mtext>pod</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>use</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cost}_{\\text{pod}} = \\max\\!\\big(q_{\\text{req}},\\, q_{\\text{use}}\\big) \\times D \\times r_{\\text{gpu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pod</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{req}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是申请卡数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>use</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{use}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">use</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该时段平均实际占卡数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{gpu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单卡小时费率。取 max 的含义是：<strong>你占着不用，也要付；你用得比申请多（共享场景），按用的付</strong>。这个规则同时惩罚了两种浪费，也是下面&quot;装箱&quot;的出发点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装箱-共享卡上的成本如何摊到每个-pod\">装箱：共享卡上的成本如何摊到每个 Pod</h2><p>独占一张卡时分摊是平凡的——一个 Pod 拿走一份 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{gpu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。难的是时切片（time-slicing）、MPS 与 MIG 把一张卡拆给多个 Pod 之后，谁付多少。</p>\n<p>时切片走的是&quot;虚报&quot;路径：device plugin 把一张物理卡重复上报 <code>replicas</code> 次，节点标签变成 <code>nvidia.com/gpu.replicas=&lt;N&gt;</code>，而 <code>nvidia.com/gpu.count</code> 仍报物理卡数〔<a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-native/gpu-operator/latest/gpu-sharing.html\">GPU Operator: GPU Sharing</a>〕。四张卡配 <code>replicas: 4</code>，调度器看到 16 个可分配的 <code>nvidia.com/gpu</code>。按 replica 均摊是最自然的记账方式——每个 Pod 承担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 卡的成本，因为文档明确说 GPU 对<strong>所有进程平等分配时间片</strong>。但这里有两个必须写进分摊办法的陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>replica 不保证算力比例</strong>。申请 2 个 replica 不等于拿到 2 倍算力，文档甚至提供 <code>failRequestsGreaterThanOne: true</code> 来拒绝多 replica 申请，正是为了打断&quot;多申请就多算力&quot;的假设。</li>\n<li><strong>时切片下 DCGM 无法把指标关联到容器</strong>。文档原文指出 DCGM-Exporter &quot;does not support associating metrics to containers&quot;——<code>pod</code>/<code>namespace</code> 标签退化为不可用，utilization 口径在这一模式下<strong>失效</strong>，唯一可靠的记账信号只剩 request 与 replica 标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MIG 相反：它把 GPC、L2 slice、显存控制器按物理路径切开，每个实例有独立的显存与带宽。这类切分的<strong>成本比例应当按内存 slice 数而非等分</strong>——一个 <code>1g.10gb</code> 实例在 A100 80GB 上只拿到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的显存带宽，若按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 均摊就低估了它对整卡的挤占。工程上的近似是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>instance</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>Y</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{instance}} = r_{\\text{gpu}} \\times \\frac{Y}{Y_{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">instance</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 是该 profile 占用的 memory slice 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是整卡 slice 总数。MIG 实例的 utilization 指标带 <code>GPU_I_PROFILE</code>，可直接与费率表匹配，这是三种共享模式里计量最干净的一种。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[&quot;一张物理卡的资产成本&quot;] --&gt; M{&quot;共享模式&quot;}&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;独占&quot;| E[&quot;按 Pod 计 1.0 卡&lt;br/&gt;信号: request&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;time-slicing&quot;| T[&quot;按 replica 均摊 1/N&lt;br/&gt;信号: replica 标签&lt;br/&gt;注意 DCGM 无法关联容器&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;MPS&quot;| P[&quot;按配置份额均摊&lt;br/&gt;信号: 静态配置&lt;br/&gt;无故障隔离&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;MIG&quot;| G[&quot;按 memory slice 比例&lt;br/&gt;信号: GPU_I_PROFILE&lt;br/&gt;计量最干净&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; A[&quot;汇总到 namespace / 团队&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt; A&#10;  P --&gt; A&#10;  G --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  R[\"一张物理卡的资产成本\"] --&gt; M{\"共享模式\"}\n  M --&gt;|\"独占\"| E[\"按 Pod 计 1.0 卡&lt;br/&gt;信号: request\"]\n  M --&gt;|\"time-slicing\"| T[\"按 replica 均摊 1/N&lt;br/&gt;信号: replica 标签&lt;br/&gt;注意 DCGM 无法关联容器\"]\n  M --&gt;|\"MPS\"| P[\"按配置份额均摊&lt;br/&gt;信号: 静态配置&lt;br/&gt;无故障隔离\"]\n  M --&gt;|\"MIG\"| G[\"按 memory slice 比例&lt;br/&gt;信号: GPU_I_PROFILE&lt;br/&gt;计量最干净\"]\n  E --&gt; A[\"汇总到 namespace / 团队\"]\n  T --&gt; A\n  P --&gt; A\n  G --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"配额核算-把-可调度的卡-换算成-可花的钱\">配额核算：把「可调度的卡」换算成「可花的钱」</h2><p>配额有两个正交维度：<strong>资源配额</strong>回答&quot;这个团队最多能同时跑几张卡&quot;，<strong>成本配额</strong>回答&quot;这个团队一个月最多能花多少钱&quot;。Kueue 把前者做得相当完整——<code>ClusterQueue</code>（API <code>kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta2</code>）用一棵 quota 树描述保证量〔<a href=\"https://kueue.sigs.k8s.io/docs/concepts/cluster_queue/\">Kueue: ClusterQueue</a>〕：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta2&#10;kind: ClusterQueue&#10;spec:&#10;  cohort: shared-gpu-pool&#10;  resourceGroups:&#10;    - coveredResources: [&#39;cpu&#39;, &#39;memory&#39;, &#39;nvidia.com/gpu&#39;]&#10;      flavors:&#10;        - name: on-demand&#10;          resources:&#10;            - name: &#39;nvidia.com/gpu&#39;&#10;              nominalQuota: 100 # 保证量&#10;              borrowingLimit: 20 # 最多向 cohort 借 20&#10;              lendingLimit: 40 # 最多借出 40（v0.17 起 stable）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterQueue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cohort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">shared-gpu-pool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resourceGroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">coveredResources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cpu'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'memory'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nvidia.com/gpu'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      flavors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">on-demand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nvidia.com/gpu'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              nominalQuota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 保证量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              borrowingLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最多向 cohort 借 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              lendingLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最多借出 40（v0.17 起 stable）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段决定多租户公平性：<code>nominalQuota</code> 是团队<strong>保证拿到</strong>的卡数，同 <code>cohort</code> 的 ClusterQueue 之间可互相借还闲置额度，<code>borrowingLimit</code> / <code>lendingLimit</code> 封顶借入借出。这正是 GPU 利用率难题的组织解法——训练团队夜间的空闲额度可被推理团队借走，而不用把卡物理切给谁。抢占由 <code>.spec.preemption</code> 控制：<code>reclaimWithinCohort</code> 与 <code>borrowWithinCohort.policy</code> 默认都是 <code>Never</code>，要允许高优作业挤掉低优作业必须显式改这两个值。</p>\n<p>成本配额是把 <code>nominalQuota</code> 乘以一条费率卡就得到的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Budget</mtext><mtext>team/month</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>nominalQuota</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>month</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Budget}_{\\text{team/month}} = \\text{nominalQuota} \\times r_{\\text{gpu}} \\times h_{\\text{month}} \\times \\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1136em;vertical-align:-0.4191em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Budget</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2809em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">team/month</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4191em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nominalQuota</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">month</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>month</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{\\text{month}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">month</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每月小时数（按 730 计），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标利用率折扣。这样&quot;配额 = 100 张卡&quot;和&quot;预算 = 每月 21.9 万美元&quot;（按 3 美元/卡时×730 小时）在财务上等价，团队超支等同于超配额，两套数字第一次可以说同一句话。</p>\n<p>面向未来，DRA 的 <strong>partitionable device</strong> 把容量核算下沉到了 API 层。ResourceSlice 允许一个设备标记 <code>partitionable: true</code>，并声明它消费的共享计数器：<code>spec.sharedCounters[].counters[].value</code> 定义总槽位，<code>spec.devices[].consumesCounters[].quantity</code> 声明单个切片消耗量〔<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubernetes-api/resource/resource-slice-v1/\">ResourceSlice v1 API</a>〕。DRA 自 v1.30 引入、<strong>v1.35 起 GA</strong>（feature gate 已锁定无法关闭），但调度器<strong>不支持 DRA 资源的抢占</strong>——高优 Pod 只能等低优 Pod 终止〔<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/dynamic-resource-allocation/\">K8s: DRA</a>〕。共享计数器让&quot;一张卡被切成几份、每份成本几分之几&quot;成为调度器可见的容量算术，而非靠外部记账脚本维持的影子表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-账目闭合-费率卡与-chargeback-落地边界\">小结：账目闭合、费率卡与 chargeback 落地边界</h2><p>分摊做到最后一定会遇到两个对不上账的数字：<strong>工作负载成本之和 &lt; 资产成本</strong>，差额就是闲置。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Idle</mtext><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>AssetCost</mtext><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>WorkloadCost</mtext><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Idle%</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Idle</mtext><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><msub><mtext>AllocationCost</mtext><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Idle}_{\\text{cluster}} = \\text{AssetCost}_{\\text{cluster}} - \\text{WorkloadCost}_{\\text{cluster}}, \\qquad \\text{Idle\\%} = \\frac{\\text{Idle}_{\\text{cluster}}}{\\text{AllocationCost}_{\\text{cluster}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Idle</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AssetCost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WorkloadCost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Idle%</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AllocationCost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Idle</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是 OpenCost 规范的定义，且有一条常被忽略的细则：<strong>按用量计费的资源不计入闲置</strong>——网络出口这类成本不会被&quot;闲置&quot;，把它们的资产成本塞进分子会算出虚高的闲置率。闲置成本必须显式分配：要么平摊给所有租户（隐含补贴），要么按各租户的资产消耗比例分（谁占得多谁多担），要么用自定义指标分。多数平台选择<strong>先展示、后分配</strong>：闲置率作为集群健康指标挂在大盘上，成本暂不计入团队账单，等利用率优化告一段落再决定归属。</p>\n<p>费率卡的来源分两种部署形态。云上直接读实例单价除以 GPU 数——例如一张单卡 H100 SXM 实例的社区云按需价在拉美区约 2.69 美元/卡时、H200 约 3.59 美元/卡时、80GB A100 约 1.19 美元/卡时（RunPod 2026 年定价页，Secure Cloud 更高）〔<a href=\"https://www.runpod.io/pricing\">RunPod Pricing</a>〕。自建机房没有现成单价，OpenCost 给的做法是<strong>按实例族的边际资源率反推</strong> CPU、GPU、RAM 的隐含价格，再按比值归一化到节点总价——例如一台 $32.77/小时、8 卡、192 vCPU、1.1TB 内存的 <code>p4d.24xlarge</code>，先估出 CPU 与内存的合理分摊，余下的即 GPU 部分。若把 GPU 份额估为 80%，单卡费率就是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>gpu</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>32.77</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.28</mn><mtext> USD/卡时</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{gpu}} = \\frac{32.77 \\times 0.8}{8} \\approx 3.28 \\ \\text{USD/卡时}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">32.77</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.28</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">USD/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">卡时</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>showback 与 chargeback 的分界</strong>不是技术问题而是治理问题。showback 是把成本<strong>展示</strong>给团队看，不产生财务后果；chargeback 是真从预算里<strong>扣</strong>。从 showback 跨到 chargeback 前必须满足三个前提：费率卡冻结一个季度、命名空间/团队标签覆盖率 100%、闲置与超额有明确的仲裁规则。少任何一条，chargeback 都会退化成&quot;谁先发现规则漏洞谁就少付&quot;的博弈。</p>\n<p>落地时最容易崩的一环是<strong>归属标签</strong>。成本分摊的维度由 <code>namespace</code>、<code>pod_label_*</code>、<code>annotation</code> 决定，而 DCGM 指标能否带上这些标签取决于是否启用 Kubernetes 映射；时切片模式下这条路直接断掉。因此一条稳健的实践是<strong>用 request/limit 作为分摊主口径，utilization 只作展示与优化信号</strong>：request 是调度器承认、不可超卖、永远可得的整数事实，而 utilization 在共享模式下恰恰最不可靠。真正对齐两份账目的动作，从来不是把利用率图表做得更漂亮，而是让每一张卡在申请那一刻就明确归属到某个团队、某条费率、某段时长。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPU 成本计量、装箱与配额核算","id":"gpu-成本计量-装箱与配额核算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三份互相矛盾、缺一不可的数据源","id":"核心概念-三份互相矛盾-缺一不可的数据源"},{"level":2,"text":"装箱：共享卡上的成本如何摊到每个 Pod","id":"装箱-共享卡上的成本如何摊到每个-pod"},{"level":2,"text":"配额核算：把「可调度的卡」换算成「可花的钱」","id":"配额核算-把-可调度的卡-换算成-可花的钱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：账目闭合、费率卡与 chargeback 落地边界","id":"小结-账目闭合-费率卡与-chargeback-落地边界"}],"prev":{"title":"GPU 可观测与利用率度量（DCGM/MFU）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/operations-observability-cost/gpu-observability-utilization"},"next":null}